                "word": "meta",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f7b0617d-7d88-42d1-86df-81ccf1e5ed78",
                        "entry_id": "42970312-0a4f-350c-bf0d-5138458ddb52",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more meta"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "2290eeee-63f0-42d0-9eb1-b4cecdd797c9",
                        "entry_id": "42970312-0a4f-350c-bf0d-5138458ddb52",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most meta"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b62caf57-4ef7-310e-b1d8-1a8399507028",
                        "entry_id": "42970312-0a4f-350c-bf0d-5138458ddb52",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Self-referential; structured analogously (structured by relationships), but at a higher level."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "67d7933f-326d-4bc1-92ce-647a7403e84c",
                                "sense_id": "b62caf57-4ef7-310e-b1d8-1a8399507028",
                                "text": "Suppose you have a genie that grants you three wishes. If you wish for infinite wishes, that is a meta wish."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d9105fe-f8a0-461c-82b2-1b3f5b8e3d36",
                                "sense_id": "b62caf57-4ef7-310e-b1d8-1a8399507028",
                                "text": "Suppose you have a homework task where you need to edit a wiki page and upload a screenshot of this entry underneath the word meta as an example of what meta is."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c6d7d0d-2937-4916-904f-dd03be9b62f8",
                                "sense_id": "b62caf57-4ef7-310e-b1d8-1a8399507028",
                                "text": "[…] in finessing obligations you fail a \"meta\" kind of obligation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d22a177-977b-4bac-92cd-74b14d58cead",
                                "sense_id": "b62caf57-4ef7-310e-b1d8-1a8399507028",
                                "text": "Besides, I can just hear Vaughan: \"Very funny, Stacey, very Charlie Kaufman-esque, very meta, very '97. I can't use it.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "539fcdb4-aed5-494c-ba48-044bc0cd925b",
                                "sense_id": "b62caf57-4ef7-310e-b1d8-1a8399507028",
                                "text": "McDonald & Dodds is back, with episode one so deliberately hammy and meta that, technically, it should have been a complete horlicks. In one scene, when they were all hanging on to the balloon ropes, Mr Bean-like, to stop Jason Watkins flying away, it sort of was."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "75d4bb8d-ae8b-3fa8-a13e-fe4f8f8f38f8",
                        "entry_id": "42970312-0a4f-350c-bf0d-5138458ddb52",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Prominent in the metagame; effective and frequently used in competitive gameplay."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e000035a-5b65-456b-8023-bd90962f42fe",
                                "sense_id": "75d4bb8d-ae8b-3fa8-a13e-fe4f8f8f38f8",
                                "text": "I don't think the character will be meta even with the recent buffs."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
